{m20_1||Inspect the hazard and extinguisher objects, confirming their status and location.}

{m20_2||Operate the sensor relay object to transmit the inspection information.}

{carter_1||Open the rescue channel button object after the relay is activated.}

{scout_1||Pick up and deliver the extinguisher object to the rescue area.}

{m20_1||Inspect the hazard, extinguisher, sensor relay, and rescue channel button objects; obtain or report their coordinates and status before any manipulation.}

{m20_2||Establish scene geometry and reachability for the hazard, extinguisher, sensor relay, and rescue channel button objects, then provide a feasible execution plan to the other agents.}

{carter_1||Using the verified object coordinates and reachability plan, activate the sensor relay object and open the rescue channel button object; report any manipulation limitation.}

{scout_1||Using the verified object coordinates and reachability plan, retrieve the extinguisher object and deliver it to the designated rescue destination; report any manipulation limitation.}

{m20_1||Inspect the hazard, extinguisher, sensor relay, and rescue channel button objects using any available scene-perception interface; report their [x,z,y] coordinates and statuses.}

{m20_2||Use any available scene-geometry interface to obtain workspace and reachability information for the hazard, extinguisher, sensor relay, and rescue channel button objects, then coordinate feasible access for the manipulation tasks.}

{carter_1||After object coordinates and reachability are verified, activate the sensor relay object and open the rescue channel button object; if direct manipulation is unavailable, coordinate with the agent that has manipulation access.}

{scout_1||After object coordinates and reachability are verified, retrieve the extinguisher object and deliver it to the rescue destination; if direct manipulation is unavailable, coordinate with the agent that has manipulation access.}

{m20_1||Nothing to do until scene-perception data for the hazard, extinguisher, sensor relay, and rescue channel button objects is provided.}

{m20_2||Nothing to do until [x,z,y] coordinates and workspace/reachability data for the hazard, extinguisher, sensor relay, rescue channel button, and extinguisher-delivery destination objects are provided.}

{carter_1||Nothing to do until a manipulation-capable agent and verified access to the sensor relay and rescue channel button objects are provided.}

{scout_1||Nothing to do until a manipulation-capable agent and verified access to the extinguisher and rescue-destination objects are provided.}
